# Learning Outcome

Through this task, I gained a practical understanding of identity management using Keycloak and object storage using MinIO. I learned how authentication systems manage users and roles, and how object storage is used to securely store and manage application files. This hands-on practice provided a strong foundation for integrating these technologies into backend applications.

